=2 Walkthrough
* **{c=red:Note: }**You must zone after finishing {q:Girl in the Looking Glass|Girl in the Looking Glass|Girl in the Looking Glass} before you can start this quest.
* Speak to {n:Luto Mewrilah} for a cutscene.
* In {z:Port San d'Oria}, head to Cargo Room B near Home Point #1 and speak to {n:Portaure} (H-9) for another cutscene that allows you to start a Burning Circle fight.
** **Note:** The battlefield applies a level cap of 40: recommend bringing level appropriate gear and food.
** The battlefield was designed to be soloable by players at level 30.
** Trust Magic can not be used.
* Go to {z:Ghelsba Outpost} and interact with the **Hut Door** (F/G-10) to enter the battlefield.
* The NM {m:Carrion Dragon} will spawn. Your Adventuring Fellow will arrive to assist you once you get it to around 80%.
** It has standard {p:Dragon|Category:Dragon} TP moves such as Thorn Song and Heavy Stomp. If you're unlucky it may use Petro Eyes and {p:Petrify} you or your fellow.
* Once the BC is complete you will receive a cutscene.
* Return to Luto to complete the quest and receive the reward.

=2 Notes
* Three people in a party may enter the BC at the same time.
* Players who have already completed the quest will not be able to enter the battlefield.

